Behavioural Driven developement

cucumber is an BDD tool( Gherkin Language)

We use Cucumber tool to write Feature files( Tests Sets)

Feature file contains Scenarios and Scenario outline

KeyWords in Cucumber

Feature - is used define entire feature
Scenario: Is used to define a Test case
Scenario Outline - is used to define Test case with Multiple sets of Test Data
Examples: Is used along with Scenario Outline to provide the test data

Given: Used to define a pre requisite
And: 
When : Action we perform and steps we take
Then : We used to validate 
And: is used to define another same step like Given, When Then.

Test data usage in Feature Files 
Step - When I enter valid username "student" and password 2789
Step Defination :
    When('I enter valid username {string} and password {float}', function (username, password) {
    loginPage.enterUsername(username);
    loginPage.enterPassword(password);
});

